{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 74,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        69.17418670654297,
        120.02171325683594,
        83.2621841430664
      ],
      "text": "Remarks",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.96521759033203,
        78.81909942626953,
        107.11021423339844
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        93.96521759033203,
        526.9642944335938,
        107.11021423339844
      ],
      "text": "This recommendation prioritizes concurrent testing of two different sample types over the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        109.46521759033203,
        376.6777648925781,
        122.61021423339844
      ],
      "text": "use of a single molecular test for diagnosis of TB in children.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        124.96521759033203,
        78.81909942626953,
        138.11021423339844
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        124.96521759033203,
        526.9653930664062,
        138.11021423339844
      ],
      "text": "Use of LC-aNAATs on isolated specimens was also evaluated. The findings supported the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        140.4652099609375,
        526.9313354492188,
        153.61021423339844
      ],
      "text": "use of LC-aNAATs for initial diagnostic testing for TB in children with signs or symptoms or",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        155.9652099609375,
        526.9971923828125,
        169.11021423339844
      ],
      "text": "who screen positive for pulmonary TB, using respiratory sample, gastric aspirate, stool or",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        171.4652099609375,
        351.6318664550781,
        184.61021423339844
      ],
      "text": "nasopharyngeal aspirate, rather than smear or culture.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        186.9652099609375,
        78.81909942626953,
        200.11021423339844
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        186.9652099609375,
        526.962890625,
        200.11021423339844
      ],
      "text": "This recommendation is strong despite the low certainty of evidence because the findings",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        202.4652099609375,
        527.248779296875,
        215.61021423339844
      ],
      "text": "indicate large desirable effects (i.e. rapid and accurate diagnosis of TB in a highly vulnerable",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.989544868469238,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        217.9652099609375,
        527.00048828125,
        231.11021423339844
      ],
      "text": "population – children – in whom diagnosing TB is often challenging) over trivial undesirable",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.98378849029541,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        233.4652099609375,
        527.2369995117188,
        246.61021423339844
      ],
      "text": "effects (i.e. negative consequences of this testing strategy) (for more details, see GRADE",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        248.9652099609375,
        332.3263854980469,
        262.1102294921875
      ],
      "text": "evidence to decision [EtD] table,  ). Web Annex A.4",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        264.4652099609375,
        78.81909942626953,
        277.6102294921875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        264.4652099609375,
        527.1843872070312,
        277.6102294921875
      ],
      "text": "The product for which eligible data met the LC-aNAAT class-based performance criteria",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        279.9652099609375,
        526.9532470703125,
        293.1102294921875
      ],
      "text": "for this recommendation was Xpert MTB/RIF Ultra. The performance of Truenat MTB Plus",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        295.4652099609375,
        524.4104614257812,
        308.6102294921875
      ],
      "text": "and MTB-RIF Dx for this recommendation could not be assessed, as data were unavailable.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        323.8115234375,
        239.91468811035156,
        340.1914978027344
      ],
      "text": "Justification and evidence",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        350.4424133300781,
        526.6475219726562,
        363.5874328613281
      ],
      "text": "LC-aNAATs on respiratory and stool samples are recommended as the first test for symptomatic",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.963489532470703,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        365.9424133300781,
        489.0464172363281,
        379.0874328613281
      ],
      "text": "children presenting with presumptive TB disease, and are widely used to diagnose TB.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        389.9463195800781,
        526.9371948242188,
        403.0913391113281
      ],
      "text": "Previous systematic reviews have traditionally assessed diagnostic accuracy of LC-aNAATs on",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        405.4463195800781,
        527.1107177734375,
        418.5913391113281
      ],
      "text": "two samples in isolation for the detection of TB in children, but in clinical practice the tests may",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.983036994934082,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        420.9463195800781,
        526.9810791015625,
        434.0913391113281
      ],
      "text": "be used concurrently (i.e. LC-aNAAT on a respiratory sample and a stool sample) and together",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        436.4463195800781,
        188.21279907226562,
        449.5913391113281
      ],
      "text": "they increase sensitivity.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        461.43389892578125,
        492.873779296875,
        475.52191162109375
      ],
      "text": "Incremental diagnostic accuracy of concurrent testing compared with single",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        475.8338928222656,
        152.19131469726562,
        489.9219055175781
      ],
      "text": "sample testing",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        501.5724792480469,
        510.3663330078125,
        515.6604614257812
      ],
      "text": "What is the incremental diagnostic accuracy of concurrent use of LC-aNAATs on",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        515.9725341796875,
        510.5557861328125,
        530.0604858398438
      ],
      "text": "respiratory and stool samples for diagnosis of pulmonary TB disease in children",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        530.37255859375,
        517.14990234375,
        544.4605102539062
      ],
      "text": "who are HIV-negative or have an unknown HIV status, with signs and symptoms",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        544.7725219726562,
        514.6719360351562,
        558.8604736328125
      ],
      "text": "or who screened positive for pulmonary TB, compared with use of an LC-aNAAT",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        559.1725463867188,
        338.53582763671875,
        573.260498046875
      ],
      "text": "on one sample type (either respiratory or stool)?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        583.9274291992188,
        526.9590454101562,
        597.0724487304688
      ],
      "text": "Eight studies (2145 participants, 173 [8.1%] of whom had TB disease) compared the accuracy",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        599.4274291992188,
        526.6949462890625,
        612.5724487304688
      ],
      "text": "of concurrent use of LC-aNAATs with respiratory and stool samples (LC-aNAATs combined)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        614.9274291992188,
        467.5086975097656,
        628.0724487304688
      ],
      "text": "versus LC-aNAAT on one sample type (either respiratory or stool) against an MRS.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        638.931396484375,
        527.1297607421875,
        652.076416015625
      ],
      "text": "Compared with LC-aNAAT on respiratory samples alone, concurrent testing had 7.1 percentage",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.959324836730957,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        654.431396484375,
        527.00732421875,
        667.576416015625
      ],
      "text": "points (95% CrI: 3.2 to 13.4) higher sensitivity and –1.7 percentage points (95% CrI: –3.8 to",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        669.931396484375,
        527.04296875,
        683.076416015625
      ],
      "text": "–0.6) lower specificity. Certainty of evidence for both sensitivity and specificity was low for",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        685.431396484375,
        526.9591064453125,
        698.576416015625
      ],
      "text": "comparison with LC-aNAAT on respiratory samples alone. Compared with LC-aNAAT on stool",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        700.931396484375,
        526.965576171875,
        714.076416015625
      ],
      "text": "alone, concurrent testing had 22.1 percentage points (95% CrI: 13.7 to 32.7) higher sensitivity",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        716.431396484375,
        526.9667358398438,
        729.576416015625
      ],
      "text": "and –4.1 percentage points (95% CrI: –8.0 to –1.7) lower specificity. Certainty of evidence was",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        731.931396484375,
        524.4100952148438,
        745.076416015625
      ],
      "text": "moderate for sensitivity and low for specificity for comparison with LC-aNAAT on stool alone.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        40.76240158081055,
        802.0169067382812,
        138.45811462402344,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "58 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        138.4571075439453,
        802.0169067382812,
        177.0811309814453,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        177.0803985595703,
        802.0169067382812,
        288.38323974609375,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Fourth edition",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}